t program) Display the thumbnail to the user (using the Linux command-line display program) Ask the user whether or not it should be rotated; if so, do it. (using the Linux command-line convert program) Ask the user for a caption, and collect it. Generate a properly oriented half-size version of the photo (using the Linux command-line convert program) When done, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":189173,"global_rank":365723},{"name":"avagin/trivial_vpn","owner":"avagin","html_url":"https://github.com/avagin/trivial_vpn","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":null,"topics":[],"score":189173,"global_rank":365727},{"name":"JohannMG/Hedgehog1","owner":"JohannMG","html_url":"https://github.com/JohannMG/Hedgehog1","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Objective-C","description":"AAA intro app for Objective-C","topics":[],"score":189173,"global_rank":365728},{"name":"greyhill/divvy","owner":"greyhill","html_url":"https://github.com/greyhill/divvy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Rust","description":"Work distribution utility for Rust","topics":[],"score":189173,"global_rank":365735},{"name":"leventeliu/load-agent","owner":"leventeliu","html_url":"https://github.com/leventeliu/load-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":null,"topics":[],"score":189173,"global_rank":365737},{"name":"cptavatar/cz-parser","owner":"cptavatar","html_url":"https://github.com/cptavatar/cz-parser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Clojure","description":"Just some clojure JSON parsing code to help do a